{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>NOTICE BEFORE PURCHASING</strong>: This is a simple retro arcade-style game similar to \u201cGals Panic!\u201d or \u201cQix\u201d where the main challenge is to overcome the increasing difficulty of each level. However, the central premise is to enjoy the high-quality erotic animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003210/extras/21d89114b8cb4358f6fc77f18bee77e5.avif?t=1763578360\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003210/extras_big/21d89114b8cb4358f6fc77f18bee77e5.webp?t=1763578360 width=1560 height=526 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY &amp; GAMEPLAY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twisted dark sorcerer has trapped the most beautiful maidens inside his collection of enchanted paintings. Only a hero armed with the legendary sword can slash through the canvases and break the spell that keeps them imprisoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines classic Qix-style gameplay with an adult twist and carefully crafted <strong>frame-by-frame</strong> animation. All set in a fantasy world with the look and feel of a classic JRPG.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003210/extras/644f49b6922604675c43fc2abea07cbe.poster.avif?t=1763578360\" width=560 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003210/extras/644f49b6922604675c43fc2abea07cbe.webm?t=1763578360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003210/extras/644f49b6922604675c43fc2abea07cbe.mp4?t=1763578360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemies, cut through the canvases with precision, and gradually free the five beauties trapped in the warlock\u2019s gallery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Detailed and fluid animations, drawn frame by frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Retro-inspired arcade gameplay with an erotic twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Five unique maidens to rescue, each with her own style and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Increasingly difficult challenges: enemies, traps, and patterns to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Unlock the full gallery and Steam achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003210/extras/gif_promo_1?t=1763578360\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the skill to outsmart the sorcerer and rescue all the maidens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003210/6a6ef9085a17de63bf2de06f3543d6a53496c385.jpg"},{"name":"Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003210/b3ea6528450384b6261114d152fa12f0f1bd6477.jpg"},{"name":"Princess Liora - The Sylvan Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003210/b5b46a319cfaccb4fb0993000d09257e61cfa5bf.jpg"},{"name":"Princess Kaida - Flame of the Highland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003210/ed1b27a6a4bb54bbf3070704301737a55cd9fa5f.jpg"},{"name":"Princess MeiMei - The Dragon Crown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003210/3da21